       "source": "CNBC",
       "via": "Google News"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Meta’s planned AI outlays are also raising credit-market concern, with Bloomberg reporting its credit-risk gauge at a fresh high.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "8fb666b6f4056f0a",
       "title": "Meta Credit Risk Gauge Hits Fresh High on AI Spending Plans - Bloomberg.com",
       "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQMl9LNFV0ZHVONzhndXpESDVFbHMwbEZTM0tpM1RoVG9fMUxlM0tjN1JXcDF6WXhOYUFENWdpaHNVeENSSmdiUVVsMUhCbVRhRzlQS1IyVXg5UkRERGVvMUEwQmt6bVpnWmdNWU4zcGxCRHhvMFZqUmNyN3ZfQkdRZFFYc2s4MlE5U2xTUHUtUTZRNUlrNG9UQ3FQZWRib3hibklfNl9OUDBrOTNJNE9F?oc=5",
       "source": "Bloomberg.com",
       "via": "Google News"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "Kering reported stable revenue, but Gucci remains under pressure; CEO Luca de Meo says reviving the brand is the priority.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "7616a469c9b70ed4",
       "title": "Kering, ricavi stabili ma soffre ancora Gucci",
