       "source": "ANSA Top News",
       "via": null
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "text": "An ECB official is calling for deeper EU integration, a relevant policy signal amid persistent debate over the bloc’s economic and financial architecture.",
     "sources": [
      {
       "key": "8911f2c145f3c753",
       "title": "ECB's Santos Pereira pushes for deeper EU integration - Reuters",
       "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQQ1VyZ3MxYmxhbTJmNGNBbFhkOG80Ulo0WklKWHZfWU5PcUhzbktCaFVtbUVaTkxPQ3ZteGFVR29CRWtlYWdFYlNFM3d3aWZ1S0NkMjNIby05N3RGSXZiVnE1WlI2T2tQOWtrNHF3S0EwMFE0aXVoYXBCNkVUX1NkTkpodTl2aFQyRld4bnZBc2hHOHFabTAwYw?oc=5",
